  "description": "The Blazer Ultra Full Suspension Electric Mountain Bike is engineered for riders who demand both comfort and adventure. Its low-step frame and extra-wide cushioned saddle make every ride smooth and effortless, whether you're gliding through city streets or tackling rugged mountain trails. Powered by a 1800W peak motor and a 48V 20Ah integrated lithium battery, it offers an impressive range of up to 90 miles (136 km) on a single charge. With a Shimano 7-speed drivetrain, 26” x 4.0” fat tires, front fork suspension, and a reliable braking system, the Blazer ensures superior stability, safety, and control. Blending power, endurance, and all-terrain comfort, the Blazer is built to take you farther—on any road, in any season.",
